    "summary": "Retained receipt e7cdea5042e54182b277e185ae576ea8 (completed, exit 0) closes the last realism limitation with all eighteen comparisons complete and satisfied. After ten rounds of ticks to every node with message delivery in between, node 1 was still in StateLeader at term 1, the re-added node was still a voter seeing leader 1, and the context-free invocation was still pending (parsed index 13), so the running logical clock neither triggers an election nor releases a held proposal; the same invocation was admitted only after the forced leader change, 4637 ms after it was issued (index 34), and its payload was then committed on all three nodes (index 35). The witness, configuration-proposal, retry and progress, control and repair observations reproduce unchanged (indices 7 to 9, 15 to 16, 18 to 19, 21 to 29, 32 to 33), with the witness admission chain still matched on context, re-admission, joint-implicit removal and admission. The interpretation for experiment e42acd6803084697a022953fe797f2d4-experiment links all seven lineage receipts by joint history, records the running-clock observation as durable knowledge with its indices, replaces the no-ticks limitation with a narrower statement about the executed tick schedule, and marks the investigation's question explained since it is now answered end to end: no code path lets the re-added member's MsgProp traffic reach a decision while the gate is disarmed, and the held request is admitted only when an observed leader change re-arms it."
